[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4829280087","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120647#issuecomment-4829280087","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120647","id":4829280087,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABH9j3Vw","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-29T05:31:17Z","updated_at":"2026-06-29T05:31:17Z","body":"> I've sat on this for a long time as I really wanted to test on all compositors, but unfortunately my emulation-based approach is giving me issues due to QEMU's mouse emulation. Sorry for that. I'm looking into a bare-metal custom liveCD solution as nothing else worked.\r\n\r\nUpdate: I managed to get a custom liveCD up, and did some bare-metal testing. For more info, see https://codeberg.org/dery/custom-fedora-kiwi-descriptions\r\n\r\nThis round, I tried both `weston-constraints` and Godot. I only tested constraints (`Input.mouse_mode`) both in the editor and the embedded game. I haven't tested the legacy warp thing (forgor :skull:)\r\n\r\n * niri ([smithay](https://github.com/Smithay/smithay) based): works great. \r\n * mutter (GNOME): Godot works great but is fussy with `weston-constraints` for some reason.\r\n * COSMIC: has some troubles with subsurfaces but it still registers *something* (IIRC confinement is treated as locking).\r\n * labwc (wlroots based): same issues as sway. I think it's a wlroots bug.\r\n * muffin (the experimental cinnamon compositor): ignores _all_ constraint requests. The protocol is announced, but I guess it's still a no-op for now?\r\n\r\nThere's more on the iso, but for one reason or another I couldn't test everything yet. Hopefully this will clears up a bit what constraints-on-subsurfaces look like across the board.\r\n\r\nOverall it seems like an improvement compared to before, as in every single \"compliant\" compositor it now honors the mouse mode as expected, instead of failing to fire.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4829280087/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4959800740","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120647#issuecomment-4959800740","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120647","id":4959800740,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ6CNpA","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"h